Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.08,0:00:05.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(一年前)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.39,0:00:14.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果事情按我们预想的方向发展\N{\fnArial\fs30}This thing goes our way
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.60,0:00:18.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要跳进那个笼子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I...Triple lindy into that box...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.50,0:00:20.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我是有去无回吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}...You know I'm not coming back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.65,0:00:29.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得发誓不会试着救我回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to promise not to try to bring me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.75,0:00:30.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去找莉莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}You go find Lisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.04,0:00:34.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你要过正常且简单有序的生活  迪恩 \N{\fnArial\fs30}You go live some normal, apple-pie life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.82,0:00:36.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,答应我  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Promise me, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.80,0:00:38.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,答应我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Promise me.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.77,0:00:48.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(如今)
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.51,0:00:59.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.14,0:01:01.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然  很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm good.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.97,0:03:21.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,[邪恶力量 第6季第1集]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.68,0:03:27.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幸亏这是在非死不可出现前  不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And thank god this is before facebook, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.22,0:03:28.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,否则我和我那只山羊肯定得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it'd be me and that goat...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.07,0:03:30.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,红透整个因特网\N{\fnArial\fs30}...All over the internet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.60,0:03:31.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-没错  -所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's right. - So...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.74,0:03:33.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别误会  好吗  别抱怨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't get me wrong, right? No complaints.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.28,0:03:35.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但如果你现在对我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you'd have said to me,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.40,0:03:37.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿  你  十五年之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Hey, you -- 15 years from now?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.92,0:03:39.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就郊区养老去吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suburbia."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.07,0:03:40.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-噢  是的  -了解吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh. Yeah. - Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.44,0:03:42.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信我  深有体会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me, I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.37,0:03:43.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你曾经周游了很多地方咯\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you've traveled around a lot, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.89,0:03:47.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错  几乎前半辈子都在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, my whole life, pretty much.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.44,0:03:52.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,然后呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.17,0:03:53.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道该说啥了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.84,0:03:55.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.16,0:03:58.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你  是什么时候搬来的  一年前吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You -- what, you moved in, what, about a year ago?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.50,0:04:00.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, thereabouts.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.10,0:04:03.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,既然我请你喝了一年的啤酒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I been buying you beer for a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.93,0:04:07.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是不是也该回馈我些惊险刺激的细节呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I think that means you owe me a couple of gory details.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.17,0:04:08.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  其实没什么好讲的  不是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. There's not much to tell, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.88,0:04:10.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也就是  嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.67,0:04:13.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我到处周游\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lived on the road...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.32,0:04:17.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找一些  没人愿意做的活儿干干\N{\fnArial\fs30}Took, uh, crap jobs that nobody else wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.17,0:04:20.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-比如呢  -比如说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Like? - Like...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.73,0:04:21.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在虫害防治中心干干\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pest control.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.90,0:04:24.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.35,0:04:25.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虫害防治中心 \N{\fnArial\fs30}Pest control.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.85,0:04:27.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.14,0:04:29.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有个搭档和你一起工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get to work with a partner.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.27,0:04:32.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你可以  帮助民众\N{\fnArial\fs30}You get to... Help people.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.80,0:04:36.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你根本无法想象有些人家的墙里都有些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have no idea what's in some people's walls.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.11,0:04:38.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些能把他们给生吞活剥了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It could eat 'em alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.31,0:04:39.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哇哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.78,0:04:43.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然  那都是过去了  而现在\N{\fnArial\fs30}'course, that was then. And now...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.36,0:04:45.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确实挺值得尊敬的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're practically respectable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.40,0:04:46.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.07,0:04:48.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess so.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.23,0:04:50.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,确切地说  应该是吓人吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's kind of scary, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.57,0:04:52.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢了  伙计们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.51,0:04:54.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.51,0:04:56.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我想她喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think she likes you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.09,0:04:57.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确定\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.56,0:04:59.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(女服务生名字和电话)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.74,0:05:02.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你怎么回事儿啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is it with you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.19,0:05:04.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,似乎  每次都这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, every time!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.57,0:05:09.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,妞儿总喜欢挖人墙角吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's like chicks specifically dig unavailable guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.90,0:05:10.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁知道啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}who knew?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.67,0:05:16.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.80,0:05:19.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-明天见  -明天见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I will see you tomorrow. - I'll see you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.26,0:05:21.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢招待了  伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.38,0:07:43.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没人打电话找失踪的人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And no one's called about a missing person?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.27,0:07:44.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,(911紧急呼叫情况)
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.82,0:07:47.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  很有可能就是今天\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, this would have been today.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.77,0:07:51.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是说温兰和欧克街那里没有任何上报吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So no reports of anything around Vineland and Oak street,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.21,0:07:53.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在改造的那个旅馆附近也没有吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}near that hotel renovation?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.14,0:07:58.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,算是直觉吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, call it a hunch.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.75,0:08:02.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我当警察很多年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been a cop for a long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.77,0:08:07.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了  是的  不  我明天打给你吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, yeah. No, I'll call you tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.18,0:08:09.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也是  伙计  再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}You too, man. Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.88,0:08:12.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.65,0:08:13.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谁啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.90,0:08:17.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,西德  我刚约了打扑克牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sid. I'm just setting up a poker game.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.40,0:08:19.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在晚上十一点半\N{\fnArial\fs30}11:30.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.90,0:08:21.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这么晚了么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is it really?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.97,0:08:25.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,难怪我打给他时他说自己都睡下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, that explains why he was asleep when I called.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.28,0:08:26.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我马上就来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be right up.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.90,0:08:29.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.64,0:10:24.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  那是枪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean! Is that a gun?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.32,0:10:25.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  不  是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.80,0:10:28.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个  我有许可证\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's -- I got a permit for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.91,0:10:31.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你拿枪就为了射格利克曼的狗吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, to shoot the Glickmans' dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.51,0:10:36.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以为是只负鼠 \N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought that was a possum.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.27,0:10:38.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,记得我说过我在虫害防治中心工作过吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Remember when I said I was in pest control?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.47,0:10:43.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,负鼠可能携带狂犬病毒  所以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, possums carry rabies, so...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.47,0:10:44.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还真不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did not know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.07,0:10:47.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是啊  是啊  负鼠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. Yeah. Possums --
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.61,0:10:50.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,负鼠会害出人命的  西德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Possums kill, Sid.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.86,0:10:53.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,见鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.19,0:10:55.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.56,0:11:02.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,硫磺\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sulfur.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.37,0:11:04.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我得走了  -等等  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I got to go.  - Hold on, dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.54,0:11:07.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,搞什么鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.22,0:11:39.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是在找锤子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just getting a hammer.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.26,0:11:42.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我刚刚碰见西德了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I just ran into Sid.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.82,0:11:46.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是不是差点把那只约克夏犬射死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you almost shoot a yorkie?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.85,0:11:48.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差不多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Technically.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.68,0:11:49.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.95,0:11:51.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.15,0:11:53.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}How come I don't believe you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.19,0:11:56.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我  我就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just -- I, uh, I-I got this --
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.06,0:11:59.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也不知道  最近有点疑神疑鬼的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, spidey sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.41,0:12:00.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.59,0:12:02.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是在猎魔吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you hunting something?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.50,0:12:04.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老实讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}Honestly?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.74,0:12:06.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一开始我以为是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, at first, I thought that I was.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.74,0:12:11.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但其实是我瞎紧张了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm pretty sure that I got worked up over nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.16,0:12:13.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's, uh, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.25,0:12:15.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有时会这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It happens.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.61,0:12:19.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你确定没事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.50,0:12:21.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不如这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you what --
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.60,0:12:24.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有猎魔强迫症\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just because, you know, I have an ocd thing about this,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.25,0:12:27.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不如你和本一起去看看电影\N{\fnArial\fs30}why don't, uh, why don't you and Ben go to the movies,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.67,0:12:28.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去芝士蛋糕工厂吃点东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}hit the cheesecake factory --
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.01,0:12:30.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,和大伙出去玩玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, hang out with the teeming masses,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.04,0:12:35.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我再最后检查一次  确保万无一失\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'll do one last sweep just to be 100%.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.44,0:12:39.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.82,0:12:40.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小心点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.87,0:12:43.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直很小心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Careful's my middle name.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.62,0:14:02.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好啊  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hiya, dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.79,0:14:06.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看看天启带来的后果\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look what the apocalypse shook loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.74,0:14:11.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,追踪我留下的线索好玩吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have fun sniffing that trail?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.50,0:14:14.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可是很享受牵着你鼻子走的感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause I sure had fun patting you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.28,0:14:15.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不可能还...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't be...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.46,0:14:16.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我当然可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, sure I can!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.03,0:14:18.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-不可能  -可以的  臭小子\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No.  - Yeah, kiddo.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.01,0:14:21.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上帝把你的好兄弟卡西救回来了  对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}The big daddy brought your pal Cass back, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.74,0:14:23.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么我就不能被救回来呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why not me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.63,0:14:27.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给你们美好的生活增添点乐趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Add a little spice to all that -- that sugar.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.79,0:14:33.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,玩真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.56,0:14:36.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们共同经历了这么多事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}After all we've been through together?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.47,0:14:40.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的小日子过的很舒服嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you got a great little life here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.62,0:14:43.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,美女老婆  那么理解你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pretty lady -- real understanding.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.14,0:14:45.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有个不错的小孩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell of a kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.33,0:14:48.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是怎么把草坪理得那么整齐的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And how do you keep your lawn so green?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.61,0:14:50.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜托  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, come on, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.79,0:14:52.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然我知道你不怎么聪明\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never been what I'd call brainy,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.26,0:14:54.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你真的傻到以为\N{\fnArial\fs30}But did you really think
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.14,0:14:56.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的小日子可以继续这么过下去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}you were gonna get to keep all of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.51,0:14:59.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你得知道我们早晚会找上门儿的  老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}You had to know that we were coming for you sometime, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.12,0:15:06.82,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你逃避不了过去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't outrun your past.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.22,0:15:33.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.05,0:15:41.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我还指望你...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was expecting, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.26,0:15:42.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,给我来个拥抱\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, a hug,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.99,0:15:46.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,或者朝我泼点圣水呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}some holy water in the face -- something.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.22,0:15:49.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我死了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So I'm dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.59,0:15:51.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这里是天堂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is heaven?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.75,0:15:52.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黄眼恶魔杀了我  然后\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yellow eyes killed me, and now --
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.96,0:15:55.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,黄眼恶魔  你见到了他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yellow eyes? That's what you saw?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.79,0:15:56.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么叫见到\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Saw"?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.86,0:15:58.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你被下毒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were poisoned.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.34,0:15:59.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以不管你以为\N{\fnArial\fs30}So whatever kind of crazy
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.35,0:16:02.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你见到了什么  都是假的\N{\fnArial\fs30}crap you think you been seeing, it's not real.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.70,0:16:11.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那么  你是真实的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, then, are you...Real?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.64,0:16:14.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-还是我...  -我是真实的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Or am I still -  - I'm real.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.14,0:16:18.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我证明给你看\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, let me save you the trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.20,0:16:43.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}All me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.58,0:16:45.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可算弄完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's nasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.39,0:16:57.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sammy?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.08,0:16:58.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.74,0:17:00.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.74,0:17:20.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait a minute, wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.59,0:17:22.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你你  你跳进去了  兄弟\N{\fnArial\fs30}You -- you -- you were -- you were gone, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.44,0:17:23.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说  就是那样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, that -- that was it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.49,0:17:25.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你到底是怎么  -我也不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- How the hell are you --  - I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.28,0:17:26.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说你不知道是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you mean you don't know?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.18,0:17:27.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是  没有头绪\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.32,0:17:29.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我就是回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I-I'm just back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.26,0:17:31.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是上帝  还是  卡西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, was it god, or -- or -- or Cass?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.18,0:17:32.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,卡西知道这事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, does Cass know anything about it?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.42,0:17:33.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说呢  我一直在召唤他\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell me. I've been calling.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.74,0:17:34.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他还没回应我的祈祷\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cass hasn't answered my prayers.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.93,0:17:36.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我甚至不知道他在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't even know where he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.87,0:17:38.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我  在下面\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I was... Down there,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.84,0:17:40.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,接着  几分钟后  开始下雨了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then, next minute, it's raining,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:40.53,0:17:43.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我发现自己独自躺在那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}and I'm lying in that field, alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.21,0:17:45.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毫无无头绪的寻找是谁救了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's kind of hard to go looking for whatever saved you
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.02,0:17:47.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这有点难\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you got no leads.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.73,0:17:48.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我找过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I looked.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.99,0:17:51.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信我  我试过了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, believe me, I looked...
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.47,0:17:54.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,找了好几周\N{\fnArial\fs30}for weeks.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.62,0:18:00.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,等等  好几周\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, weeks?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.64,0:18:02.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你回来多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long you been back?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.34,0:18:06.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你回来多久了  萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long you been back, Sam?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.52,0:18:07.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一年左右\N{\fnArial\fs30}About a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.52,0:18:09.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-一年了  -迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- About a year?  - Dean --
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.16,0:18:12.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一整年来你都在这个世上\N{\fnArial\fs30}You been back practically this whole time?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.52,0:18:15.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你该死的失去了发消息的能力了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, did you lose the ability to send a friggin' text message?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.29,0:18:16.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你终于得到梦寐以求的东西了  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}You finally had what you wanted, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.47,0:18:19.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-我想要我的弟弟活着  -你想要个家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I wanted my brother, alive.  - You wanted a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.84,0:18:22.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想了很久了  一直以来都想  我了解你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have for a long time, maybe the whole time. I know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.64,0:18:25.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为我们生存的方式你才放弃了这个想法\N{\fnArial\fs30}You only gave it up because of the way we lived.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.51,0:18:27.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你拥有了常人的生活  建立了家庭\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you had something, and you were building something.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.91,0:18:29.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果我就这么出现了  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Had I shown up, Dean,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.94,0:18:31.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你就会离开这种生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}you would have just run off.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.80,0:18:35.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.61,0:18:37.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但这感觉就像  一切过后\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it felt like after everything,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.80,0:18:40.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你应该过上正常人的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}you deserved some regular life.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.90,0:18:50.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你都在做些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What have you been doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.55,0:18:52.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,猎魔抓鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hunting.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.08,0:18:57.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你把我甩开  自己单干吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You left me alone, and you were flying solo?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.19,0:18:58.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不是单干\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not solo.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.47,0:19:00.09,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-什么  -我和一些朋友一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What?  - I hooked up with some other people.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.14,0:19:01.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你竟然和陌生人共事\N{\fnArial\fs30}You? Working with strangers?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.50,0:19:03.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们更像是家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're more like family.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.04,0:19:06.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们就在这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.53,0:19:26.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.39,0:19:30.69,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天哪  对于猎魔人来说  你的脸真是精致\N{\fnArial\fs30}My god, you have delicate features for a hunter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.77,0:19:31.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.65,0:19:33.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  这位是格温·坎贝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, Gwen Campbell.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.58,0:19:35.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,终于见到你了  萨姆经常提起你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good to finally meet you. Sam's gone on and on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.72,0:19:37.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这位是克里斯蒂安\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this is Christian...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.93,0:19:40.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有马克\N{\fnArial\fs30}...and Mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.93,0:19:43.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坎贝尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Campbell.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.01,0:19:45.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.85,0:19:47.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坎  坎贝尔  像\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cam-- Campbell? Like...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.55,0:19:49.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是你们母亲的姓\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like your mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.39,0:19:52.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们是第三代的堂表兄妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're cousin. Third cousin.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.47,0:19:54.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,更远的远房亲戚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something, something twice removed.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.44,0:19:57.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们的成长经历  跟妈妈和我们一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}They grew up in the life, like mom and like us.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.89,0:20:00.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我以为妈妈的亲戚都没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought all of mom's relatives were gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.72,0:20:03.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.58,0:20:07.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是  为什么我一个都不认识\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's just, you know, why didn't we know about any of you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.34,0:20:09.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们也不认识你\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause they didn't know about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.64,0:20:15.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但现在我让你们团聚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not until I brought you all together.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.00,0:20:17.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨穆埃尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Samuel?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.08,0:20:18.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,来抱抱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.31,0:20:21.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是你外公\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm your grandfather.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.21,0:20:34.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子们  给我点时间和我外孙独处  谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, give me a second with my grandsons here, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.41,0:20:45.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天你见到了好多死而复生的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lot of resurrections in your face today.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.48,0:20:47.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事  花一分钟接受事实\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all right. Take a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.65,0:20:49.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,肯定要比一分钟久\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna take a little more than a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.03,0:20:50.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, what the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.68,0:20:52.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这  这是怎么发生的\N{\fnArial\fs30}H-how did this happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.69,0:20:55.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们猜想救了萨姆的东西复活了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're guessing whatever pulled Sam up pulled me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.53,0:20:57.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管它是什么  我们都成了它的一部分\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, whatever this is, we're both a part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.53,0:20:59.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但你们还不知道它是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you don't know what that is.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.11,0:21:01.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bingo.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.18,0:21:04.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们没有线索  一头雾水是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you have no leads? Nothing?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.00,0:21:07.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这  这真是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, this -- this is, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.89,0:21:12.34,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不会再有复活者从那扇门走出来了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No more doornails coming out of that door, is there?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.42,0:21:15.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就我们所知  只有萨穆埃尔  和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}As far as we know, it's Samuel, and it's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.05,0:21:19.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我是这里唯一一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, am I the only one here
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.30,0:21:22.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,觉得这不太对劲吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}that thinks that this can't all just be fine?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.19,0:21:25.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,相信我  没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Believe me, you're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.02,0:21:27.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也很想去找你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to come get you, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.67,0:21:29.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只是萨姆执意不肯把你牵扯进来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam was adamant about leaving you out,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.31,0:21:31.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以我们尊重他的意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}so we did.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.69,0:21:33.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,直到这事发生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.17,0:21:35.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.89,0:21:37.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可你们怎么会跑到我车库里去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, then you ended up in my garage how?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.75,0:21:40.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在你被袭击的前几天  我也被袭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got hit before you did, few days ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.37,0:21:42.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们给我下毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dosed up with poison.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.13,0:21:43.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-谁下的毒  -灯灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}- By? - Couple of djinn.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.71,0:21:44.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,灯灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Djinn?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.85,0:21:47.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一直以为它们常年隐居洞穴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought those were -- were cave-dwelling hermit-type.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.04,0:21:48.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,特立独行\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's pretty exotic.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.03,0:21:50.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看来它们的习性变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not anymore, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.71,0:21:51.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们和普通人没什么两样\N{\fnArial\fs30}These...look like regular people.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.53,0:21:52.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能轻松融入人类的世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}They can blend in.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.50,0:21:54.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哪怕与你轻微碰触  就能叫你一命呜呼\N{\fnArial\fs30}And all they got to do to kill you is touch you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.59,0:21:55.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,其毒液一旦侵入你体内\N{\fnArial\fs30}Their toxins get in your system,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.04,0:21:57.05,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不多时  便会使你产生幻觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}all of a sudden you're hallucinating
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.13,0:21:58.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,令噩梦时时闪现\N{\fnArial\fs30}your worst nightmares,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.57,0:22:00.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没多久  你就会踏上黄泉路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and pretty soon you O.D.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.20,0:22:01.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那为什么你现在安然无恙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then how are you breathing air?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.82,0:22:03.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨穆埃尔找到了解药\N{\fnArial\fs30}Samuel had a cure.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.92,0:22:05.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有办法解灯灵的毒\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got a cure for djinn poison?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.65,0:22:06.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,略知一二\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know a few things.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.07,0:22:07.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有空我教你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stick around, I'll show you tricks
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.95,0:22:09.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这可是你老爸毕生梦寐以求的本事\N{\fnArial\fs30}your daddy never even dreamed of.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.64,0:22:15.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么这东西会盯上我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, why are these things after us?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.25,0:22:18.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,以前我们干掉过他们的同伙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you did stake one a while back.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.24,0:22:19.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们找上我之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}After they came after me,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.05,0:22:20.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们敢肯定\N{\fnArial\fs30}we were pretty certain that
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.71,0:22:22.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们也一定不会放过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}they were gonna go gunning for you next.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.68,0:22:26.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莉莎和本  这会应该到家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lisa and Ben -- they're at the house right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.19,0:22:27.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-要是那东西现在找上门来  -别担心\N{\fnArial\fs30}- If that thing comes back - It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.50,0:22:28.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我找人在那边看着他们呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I already sent someone over there to watch 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.27,0:22:30.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你现在赶紧送我回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to take me home right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:38.90,0:22:40.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莉莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lisa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.46,0:22:42.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莉莎  本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lisa! Ben?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.17,0:22:48.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ben!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.78,0:23:21.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们到底跑哪儿去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell have you been?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.99,0:23:24.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们去看电影了  有跟你说过的啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}We -- we were at the movies. You knew that.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.02,0:23:25.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.14,0:23:28.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,发生什么事了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.26,0:23:30.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你们快上楼收拾东西  -我们要去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Go upstairs and pack a bag. - Where are we going?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.11,0:23:31.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我一个老友家  快去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm taking us to a friend's house. Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.96,0:23:34.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别担心  你先上去  我就来\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. Go on up. I'll be there in a sec.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.00,0:23:43.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my god.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.47,0:23:45.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莉莎  本  不知道你们还记不记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lisa, Ben, I don't know if you remember --
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.02,0:23:47.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:56.59,0:23:58.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,靠\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.14,0:24:00.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,很高兴见到你  鲍比  好久不见\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's good to see you, too, Bobby. It's been a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.77,0:24:03.35,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来一定有大事\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you're here, something's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.45,0:24:06.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  这是莉莎和本\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, this is Lisa and Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.64,0:24:10.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,终于还是见面了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's nice to finally meet you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:11.44,0:24:13.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,把这儿当自己家吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mi casa es su casa.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:14.02,0:24:16.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你们上楼歇歇吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you want to just go upstairs.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.30,0:24:19.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,电视坏了  不过我这读者文摘倒有不少\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tv's broken, but there's plenty of Reader's Digest.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.13,0:24:23.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,屋里的东西别乱碰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just don't touch the decor, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:23.50,0:24:25.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,假装是一碰就走火了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Assume it's all loaded.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:30.66,0:24:32.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比  你好啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Bobby.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.20,0:24:35.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨姆\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sam.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.86,0:24:45.41,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这事你知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.53,0:24:48.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道萨姆没死\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew Sam was alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.23,0:24:50.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.31,0:24:52.47,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.56,0:24:54.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-听着  -多久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Look - How long?!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.06,0:24:57.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一年了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All year.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.59,0:25:02.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你开玩笑呢吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got to be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.07,0:25:03.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,时光倒流我仍旧会这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'd do it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:04.03,0:25:06.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-为什么  -因为你退出江湖了  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Why?! - Because you got out, Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.49,0:25:08.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你离开了这种生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}You walked away from the life.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.20,0:25:10.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我他妈的有多高兴\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I was so damn grateful,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.88,0:25:11.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你根本就不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got no idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.06,0:25:14.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道抛下一切于我意味着什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you have any clue what walking away meant for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.37,0:25:16.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然知道  回到老婆孩子身边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah -- a woman and a kid
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.95,0:25:19.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不再为英年早逝而惴惴不安\N{\fnArial\fs30}and not getting your guts ripped out at age 30.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.38,0:25:20.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那就意味着这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what it meant.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.30,0:25:21.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,老婆孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}That woman and that kid
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.15,0:25:22.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是因为你求我  才去找的\N{\fnArial\fs30}-- I went to them because you asked me to.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:22.78,0:25:24.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-很好  -对谁有好处\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Good. - Good for who?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.31,0:25:25.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我当时满脑子悲伤快逆流成河了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I showed up on their doorstep
Dialogue: 0,0:25:25.30,0:25:28.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就那样莫名其妙出现在他们家门口\N{\fnArial\fs30}half out of my head with grief.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:28.17,0:25:29.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,天知道她俩怎么会让我进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}God knows why they even let me in.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:29.49,0:25:32.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我夜夜买醉  噩梦连连  \N{\fnArial\fs30}I drank too much. I had nightmares.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:32.53,0:25:35.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,走街串巷  收集了上千本书\N{\fnArial\fs30}I looked everywhere. I collected hundreds of books,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.99,0:25:37.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,千方百计想把你救出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Trying to find anything to bust you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.98,0:25:38.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说过不会再管的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You promised you'd leave it alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:39.04,0:25:40.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我怎么可能不管\N{\fnArial\fs30}Of course I didn't leave it alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.61,0:25:42.31,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,报警抓我啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sue me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.43,0:25:44.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一整年\N{\fnArial\fs30}A damn year?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.22,0:25:47.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你眼睁睁看我深陷痛苦的泥沼却不来拉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You couldn't put me out of my misery?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.69,0:25:50.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  我知道一切都很难接受\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I get it wasn't easy.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.62,0:25:52.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但这就是生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}But that's life!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.16,0:25:53.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是猎魔人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's as close to happiness
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.93,0:25:56.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,永远无法得到的幸福生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}as I've ever seen a hunter get.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.66,0:26:00.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,孩子  骗你非我本意\N{\fnArial\fs30}It ain't like I wanted to lie to you, son.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:00.37,0:26:02.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是你已经隐退了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you were out, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.55,0:26:05.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我看起来像退出了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do I look out to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.69,0:26:16.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's he doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.25,0:26:18.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事  你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's okay. How are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:22.11,0:26:24.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鲍比是有点古里古怪的  但他是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I know Bobby's a little crotchety, but he's great.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:24.86,0:26:26.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他会好好照顾你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's gonna look after you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.57,0:26:28.77,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我和萨姆要走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and Sam, we're gonna head out.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.41,0:26:35.44,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}For how long?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:41.32,0:26:43.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莉莎  对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry, Lisa.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.31,0:26:44.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,对不起什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}For what?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.32,0:26:45.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这些事情都是冲着我来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those things were coming for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.99,0:26:47.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我早该知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I should've known.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.64,0:26:49.63,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,恶魔的踪迹又岂是你能预料的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How could you know a monster was gonna show up?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.69,0:26:51.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我早该知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should've known.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:51.46,0:26:52.52,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我早该知道如果和你在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should've known that if I stayed with you
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.57,0:26:53.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它们就会跟来\N{\fnArial\fs30}That something would come,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.64,0:26:55.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是它们一贯的行事风格\N{\fnArial\fs30}because something always does.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:55.90,0:26:59.21,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我太傻太鲁莽了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I was stupid and reckless and...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.72,0:27:02.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过去的一切刻骨铭心\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can't outrun your past.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:04.34,0:27:06.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是来道别的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're saying goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.78,0:27:25.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是来道歉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm saying I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:25.71,0:27:27.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为一切的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}For everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:28.57,0:27:30.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.10,0:27:33.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真是个笨蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.34,0:27:34.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,虽然我们的生活不够完美\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I know it wasn't greeting-card perfect,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.98,0:27:36.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是至少我们在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we were in it together.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.23,0:27:37.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我几乎是个废人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was a wreck half the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:37.31,0:27:39.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那个拯救了世界的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, the guy that basically just saved the world
Dialogue: 0,0:27:39.36,0:27:40.22,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,突然出现在你门前\N{\fnArial\fs30}shows up at your door,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.29,0:27:42.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你希望他是有事而来\N{\fnArial\fs30}you expect him to have a couple of issues.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.74,0:27:49.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你和本一直都相处融洽\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're always so amazing with Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:51.51,0:27:55.39,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你知道我需要什么  我只是需要\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I wanted, more than anything...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.47,0:27:56.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}was...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.67,0:28:01.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本能够崇拜的对象\N{\fnArial\fs30}...a guy that Ben could look up to...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.02,0:28:06.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像\N{\fnArial\fs30}...like...
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.04,0:28:09.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像一个父亲\N{\fnArial\fs30}like a dad.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.51,0:28:13.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  你觉得这样不好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you're saying it's all bad, Dean?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.09,0:28:17.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是这一年是我一生中最美好的日子\N{\fnArial\fs30}'cause it was the best year of my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.83,0:28:35.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有什么安排\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's the plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.85,0:28:39.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在先备好货  准备起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, right now, we stock up, get set.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.22,0:28:44.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的意思是  没安排\N{\fnArial\fs30}So you're saying there is no plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:44.17,0:28:45.53,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们从长计议\N{\fnArial\fs30}We'll find 'em.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.61,0:28:47.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,耐心一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just got to be patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.20,0:28:49.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯  好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.33,0:28:50.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我有个建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, here's an alt.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.56,0:28:53.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们干嘛不直接去干掉那些\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why don't we go kill the sons of bitches
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.08,0:28:54.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,闯进我家里的混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}that broke into my home?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.75,0:28:56.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  冷静点  我们会处理的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Relax, Dean. We got it handled.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.63,0:28:58.89,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,灯灵很难对付\N{\fnArial\fs30}Djinn are hard to draw out.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.38,0:29:00.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你有一段时间没接触这些了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you've been out of the game for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:00.72,0:29:02.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,交给专家吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Leave it to the professionals.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.53,0:29:04.68,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好  没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.26,0:29:08.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小小的建议\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tiny suggestion.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.27,0:29:12.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,设个诱饵  灯灵会好对付些\N{\fnArial\fs30}You see, djinn are easier to draw out when you got bait.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.33,0:29:14.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们想要的是萨姆和我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They want Sam and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.35,0:29:15.49,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们知道我住在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}They know where I live.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.58,0:29:18.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我已经很久都没猎魔了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I haven't been hunting in a while,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.26,0:29:19.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这次准备豁出去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I'm gonna stick my neck out
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.33,0:29:22.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去我家吧  再适合不过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}and guess that's a pretty good place for us to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.66,0:29:28.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,瞧  我还是挺专业的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}See? It's almost like I'm a professional.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:41.14,0:29:42.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我喜欢这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love this one.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.84,0:29:46.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的还是你老婆的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yours or, uh, your wife's?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.22,0:29:55.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,帮个忙  别碰这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do me a favor -- don't touch that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.32,0:29:59.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,高尔夫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Golf?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.13,0:30:01.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你不是吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.54,0:30:04.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就是  就是运动运动啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's a -- it's a sport.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.92,0:30:17.07,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,房子不错啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nice house.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.45,0:30:22.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好啦  我是辣妈行了吧  随你埋汰\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah. Go ahead, say it -- call me a soccer mom.Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.52,0:30:24.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,"辣妈"\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Soccer mom," Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.07,0:30:27.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我得去内联网上查查这词\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I'll have to look that up on the "Intranet."
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.71,0:30:29.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管你信不信  我...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, believe it or not, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.62,0:30:30.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我懂  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.78,0:30:32.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想过普通人的生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanted a normal life.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.55,0:30:35.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你母亲曾经也这么想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your mom wanted a normal life, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:36.89,0:30:39.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的人生观\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remind me of her, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.21,0:30:42.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,让我情不自禁想起了她\N{\fnArial\fs30}The attitude, for one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.89,0:30:44.76,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你弟弟告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your brother tell you what
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.82,0:30:47.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,过去几个月我们一直在对付什么了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}we've been dealing with the past few months?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.26,0:30:48.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还没\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, not really.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.90,0:30:50.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我从没见过类似的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never seen anything quite like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.46,0:30:52.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,日夜不停地搞破坏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Been working 'round the clock.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.26,0:30:54.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-那到底是什么  -我们不清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So what's going on?  - We don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:54.50,0:30:54.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,无论是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}But whatever it is,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:55.01,0:30:57.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,它远超过几个灯灵一起作怪\N{\fnArial\fs30}it goes way past a couple of djinn acting off --
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.37,0:30:59.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就像夜行怪在白天攻击\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nocturnals attacking in broad daylight,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:59.94,0:31:01.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,狼人在月缺之夜活动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Werewolves out on the half-moon,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.15,0:31:03.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这种生物我们闻所未闻\N{\fnArial\fs30}creatures that we've never even seen before.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.32,0:31:05.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们根本不清楚它们是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't...we don't even know what they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.13,0:31:07.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我见到很多被吃了一半的人类心脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm knee-deep in half-eaten human hearts
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.50,0:31:09.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还有被吸干血的十岁孩童\N{\fnArial\fs30}and exsanguinated 10-year-olds,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.29,0:31:12.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一切令我\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it's all making me...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.89,0:31:15.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,惶恐不安\N{\fnArial\fs30}uneasy.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:15.91,0:31:16.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你觉得是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So what's your theory?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:16.88,0:31:18.48,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你来告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:18.59,0:31:20.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们只知道它正蓄势待发\N{\fnArial\fs30}All we really know is it's all hands on deck.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.49,0:31:21.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,现在我们只能互相扶持了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're counting on each other right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.89,0:31:24.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坎贝尔家族的命运也在此一搏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how it is with Campbells.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.80,0:31:27.36,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  我们需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need you, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.43,0:31:28.95,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明白  但是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I hear you, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:29.02,0:31:31.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  你是家族的一份子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't know what you're part of, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.29,0:31:39.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你的祖辈在"五月花"号上取下了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, you had ancestors hacking the heads off vamps
Dialogue: 0,0:31:39.21,0:31:41.74,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,吸血鬼的首级\N{\fnArial\fs30}on the Mayflower.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.23,0:31:46.56,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要说的是我们血脉相连\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I'm saying is that we're your blood.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:46.64,0:31:47.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当我们面对死亡威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we're out there dying,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.68,0:31:50.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,尝试去阻止未知的怪物\N{\fnArial\fs30}trying to get in front of whatever this is.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:50.51,0:31:54.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,也许现在不是打高尔夫的最好时机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe not the best time for golf.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:10.63,0:32:12.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你好像不太爱说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't really say much, do you?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:12.79,0:32:15.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沉默是金\N{\fnArial\fs30}Enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:15.79,0:32:17.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有它们活动的迹象吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any sign of 'em?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:24.65,0:32:28.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,树丛中有三个灯灵\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three djinn off in the trees.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:39.55,0:32:42.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那些灯灵坐在那里盯着我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Those djinn are just sitting out there, watching us.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:42.13,0:32:44.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-大家都走吧  -什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Everybody's got to clear out.  - What?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:44.31,0:32:46.27,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,除非我和萨姆落单  否则他们不会来\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not gonna come in here until me and Sam are alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:46.40,0:32:49.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是要我们抛下你们  孤立无援吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what, I'm supposed to leave you here with no backup?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.21,0:32:50.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩说的对\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.38,0:32:53.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们很聪明  不等人数占优是绝不动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're smart. They'd wait till they weren't outnumbered.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.23,0:32:57.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好吧  我们不会走远\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we won't be far.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:57.93,0:33:00.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,他们一来就打电话给我们  听到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You call when they come, you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.12,0:33:02.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bet.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:02.11,0:33:04.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好的  收拾东西  准备离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, pack up. We're out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:27.68,0:33:29.86,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.39,0:33:34.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,还好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:34.18,0:33:36.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  这...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. No, this is...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.96,0:33:38.59,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这太疯狂了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:38.71,0:33:40.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我是说  你  外公\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you, grandpa.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.98,0:33:43.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不管是谁让你们起死回生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever brought you back...
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.26,0:33:45.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-他们不想被发现  -我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- They don't want to be found.  - Yeah, I get that.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.48,0:33:48.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但他们是谁  想要什么  又为了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}But who are they, and what do they...what do they want? Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.30,0:33:51.14,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也想知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a good question.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.16,0:33:55.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你还记得吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you remember it?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.43,0:33:59.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.55,0:34:02.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-那个笼子  -记得\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The cage. - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.49,0:34:05.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-你想要  -不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You want to... - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.55,0:34:06.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果这事和谁有关\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, if anybody can relate...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:06.63,0:34:09.24,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  我不想谈这事了  我回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, I don't want to talk about it. I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.31,0:34:12.29,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可以呼吸到新鲜空气  喝上啤酒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get to breathe fresh air, h-have a beer,
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.40,0:34:14.73,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,全家一同猎魔  并与你重逢\N{\fnArial\fs30}hunt with my family, see you again.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.89,0:34:18.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我又何必去想地狱里的事呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So why exactly would I want to think about hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.08,0:34:22.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你真的认为...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you really think...
Dialogue: 0,0:34:39.62,0:34:41.19,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩  他们已经死了  你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean, they're already dead, and you know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.28,0:34:42.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这一切因我而起\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is happening because of me!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.03,0:34:45.01,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dean!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.35,0:35:09.61,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,西德 \N{\fnArial\fs30}Sid.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:19.34,0:35:20.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,上次你逃过一劫\N{\fnArial\fs30}You made it through that last trip,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:21.08,0:35:24.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要不这次来份巨无霸补回来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}So how about a big, fat double dose?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:27.74,0:35:30.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,坏消息是它会杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bad news...it'll kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:30.55,0:35:32.11,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好消息就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}The good news?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.21,0:35:34.04,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,至少你会死个痛快\N{\fnArial\fs30}At least you'll go fast.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.80,0:35:48.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这是为我们父亲报仇  你这狗日的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's for our father, you son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.22,0:36:36.26,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我  我在那屋子里睡不着\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just -- I-I couldn't sleep at that house.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.92,0:36:41.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没事  别担心  一会给迪恩打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. Don't worry. We'll call Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:41.32,0:36:43.79,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,别担心他们  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, don't worry about them, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.89,0:36:46.55,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看我的吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Worry about me.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.06,0:36:56.85,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.44,0:37:12.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好了好了  孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}There, there, kiddo.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:12.90,0:37:15.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,离他远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stay away from him!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.66,0:37:20.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莉莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lisa!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.99,0:37:26.99,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-喝下去吧  -本  不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Drink it. - Ben, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.10,0:37:27.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会感觉好些的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:27.92,0:37:29.78,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:33.51,0:37:35.46,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是你的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:36.85,0:37:38.88,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莉莎\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lisa!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.24,0:37:41.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这  这东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}This, something else --
Dialogue: 0,0:37:41.54,0:37:43.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们都知道这是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}we both know that's details.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:43.29,0:37:45.65,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,日后他必会受到这个的影响\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's something's coming for this one,
Dialogue: 0,0:37:45.75,0:37:46.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你是无法阻止的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you can't stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.03,0:37:48.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,都是你的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's all your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.72,0:37:50.32,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-莉莎  -喝了它\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Lisa! - Drink it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.42,0:37:51.17,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会感觉好些的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll feel better.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:51.26,0:37:52.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-本  别喝  -你的错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ben, don't! - Your fault.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:52.52,0:37:53.83,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你阻止不了的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:55.58,0:37:57.97,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.19,0:38:21.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我来对付她  你去帮迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got her. Go get Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:32.52,0:38:34.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-抓住她了  -放轻松  宝贝  \N{\fnArial\fs30}- Got her. - Relax, hon.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:35.03,0:38:35.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们不会杀你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not gonna kill you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:36.04,0:38:38.18,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快点  在他们回来前  把她塞进货车里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get her in the van. Quick, now, before the boys get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:59.38,0:39:01.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,萨穆埃尔和卡瑟斯去哪儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, Samuel and the Cuzzes?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.61,0:39:03.12,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不知道  他们匆匆离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't know. They left in a hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.21,0:39:03.98,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我们在他们家那边汇合\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm meeting them back at their place.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:04.09,0:39:07.96,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你  你要和我一起走吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, uh, you coming with me?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:08.52,0:39:09.72,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:09.81,0:39:12.37,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要回去照看莉莎和本\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm going back for Lisa and Ben.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:12.48,0:39:13.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你说了...\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you said --
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.30,0:39:15.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是的  我改变主意了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did. I changed my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:16.79,0:39:19.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着  虽然我当时几乎是逼着你去找他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I practically shoved you at them.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:19.66,0:39:21.02,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这说法倒是挺好笑  继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's a funny way to put it, but all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:21.11,0:39:23.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我说的是  我也希望你能有个家\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just saying, I really wanted that for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:23.17,0:39:26.03,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我让你去找他们的时候  我是觉得\N{\fnArial\fs30}And when I told you to go, I-I thought...
Dialogue: 0,0:39:26.10,0:39:27.81,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你会幸福的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You could have it, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.90,0:39:30.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但是现在我不确定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But now I'm not so sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:30.61,0:39:31.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你需要考虑的实际情况是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you got to consider the fact
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.83,0:39:34.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,如果你回去了  会把他们推向火坑\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you'll be putting them in danger if you go back.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:34.83,0:39:36.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那该如何  最好远离他们么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what, it's better to leave them alone,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.39,0:39:37.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,没人保护他们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}unprotected,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:37.19,0:39:38.91,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这样就没有危险了是么\N{\fnArial\fs30}and then they're not in danger?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.00,0:39:40.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这都是我一手造成的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did this to them.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:40.31,0:39:42.33,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我进入了他们的生活  他们才会有危险的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I made them vulnerable the moment I knocked on their door,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:42.40,0:39:44.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,覆水难收  我无能为力\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I can't undo that.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:44.67,0:39:48.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我能弥补的是  择优而行\N{\fnArial\fs30}But what I can do is go with the best option.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.91,0:39:55.23,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:56.78,0:39:58.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess I just, uh
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.67,0:40:00.92,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,希望你能一起来  没别的\N{\fnArial\fs30}wish you were coming, that's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:01.02,0:40:04.08,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:04.25,0:40:05.84,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,-别犯傻了  -不  我认真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Don't be stupid. - No, I mean it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:05.93,0:40:07.57,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你认识那么多优秀的猎魔人  \N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you know plenty of good hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:07.66,0:40:08.64,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我都生疏了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm rusty.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:08.72,0:40:10.38,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我刚刚就那么冲过去  实在是极度愚蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did something seriously stupid going out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:10.45,0:40:12.62,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,差点连累我俩都死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I almost got us both killed.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:12.73,0:40:14.87,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,这就是为什么我需要你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's exactly why I want you.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:14.99,0:40:16.71,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你这是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.81,0:40:18.67,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你坚决果断\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just went.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:18.77,0:40:19.93,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,毫不犹豫\N{\fnArial\fs30}You didn't hesitate.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:20.03,0:40:23.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因为你在乎他们  你就是这样的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because you care, and that's who you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.22,0:40:25.54,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.65,0:40:27.15,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我连去尝试的想法都没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wouldn't even think to try.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:27.25,0:40:30.43,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  你也会那么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you would.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:30.51,0:40:32.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Dean.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.70,0:40:35.16,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我要告诉你  有你在身边很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm telling you, it's just better with you around.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.25,0:40:37.58,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's all.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.75,0:40:43.25,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen...
Dialogue: 0,0:40:47.51,0:40:50.75,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她应该继续猎魔的  带上她\N{\fnArial\fs30}She should be hunting. Take her.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:55.54,0:40:58.66,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,谢谢  真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks. Really.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.77,0:41:02.51,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,但我有一辆自己的爱车了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I already got my car set up how I like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:03.18,0:41:06.13,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我该上路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I should hit the road.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:06.24,0:41:08.45,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我送你出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll walk you out.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:13.76,0:41:16.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,保持联系  听到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Keep in touch, you hear?
Dialogue: 0,0:41:16.54,0:41:19.42,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}'course.
Dialogue: 0,0:41:22.80,0:41:25.06,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能再见到你真不错  迪恩\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was really good to see you again, Dean.
